---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import { park } from '../data/park';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Rawal Lake Visitor Guide from Lake View Park"
  description="Rawal Lake visitor guide from Lake View Park Islamabad: the reservoir’s role, best viewpoints, boating caution and ecology."
  path="/rawal-lake-guide/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'What is Rawal Lake?', a: 'The reservoir that gives Lake View Park its setting and supplies much of Islamabad’s water. The park is just one front along its shore.' },
    { q: 'What’s the best way to view it?', a: 'The park’s open lakefront is the easiest place to take in the water and the hills beyond; bird and wildlife sightings are never guaranteed.' },
    { q: 'Can I boat on Rawal Lake?', a: 'Boating depends on water level, weather and management and is not guaranteed daily. Confirm operation and any charge with the on-site operator.' },
    { q: 'How do I reach the lakefront?', a: 'Use the park’s Plus Code and follow on-site paths rather than any claimed-exact private coordinate.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Rawal Lake guide', href: '/rawal-lake-guide/' }]}
  image="/images/lake-view-park-rawal-lake.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Rawal Lake views', href: '/rawal-lake-views/' },
    { label: 'Boating', href: '/boating/' },
    { label: 'Visitor rules', href: '/visitor-rules/' },
    { label: 'Nearby attractions', href: '/nearby-attractions/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Rawal Lake is the reservoir that gives Lake View Park its setting — and much of Islamabad its water. This guide looks at the lake itself, viewed from the park.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">What Rawal Lake is</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The lake supplies the capital and forms an urban green and recreational front along its shore, including the park. Its health depends on surrounding land use and visitor behaviour.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Viewing it</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The park’s open lakefront is the easiest place to take in the water and the hills beyond. For angles and light, see <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/rawal-lake-views/">Rawal Lake views</a>. Sightings of birds and wildlife are never guaranteed.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Boating caution</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Boating on the lake depends on water level, weather and management, and is not guaranteed daily. Confirm operation and any charge with the on-site operator (see <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/boating/">boating</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Protecting it</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Use bins, avoid single-use plastic, stay on paths and don’t feed wildlife. Small habits keep the shoreline clean for everyone and help the reservoir’s ecology.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">Pin the park, not a private spot</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">To reach the lakefront, use the park’s Plus Code {park.plusCode} and follow on-site paths rather than any claimed-exact coordinate.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Enjoy it without assumptions</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The lake is the park’s main draw and needs no ticket to enjoy from the shore. Treat boating as a confirm-on-site extra, protect the ecology by staying on paths and using bins, and navigate by the park’s own reference point.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Rawal Lake checklist" items={[
      'View the lake from the open lakefront — no booking.',
      'Confirm boating with the on-site operator if you want it.',
      'Keep to paths; don’t feed wildlife or litter.',
      'Use the park’s Plus Code, not a private coordinate.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/lake-view-park-rawal-lake.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Lake View Park lakeshore along Rawal Lake, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={1} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
